    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "GLM47 activated Novijen's +1/+1 counter ability during combat, but looking at the board, Guardian Augmenter and Incubation Druid are the creatures they control. Neither of these entered the battlefield this turn (they were already on the board from previous turns), so the ability does nothing - it puts +1/+1 counters on each creature that entered this turn, and no creatures entered this turn. This wastes {G}{U} mana and taps Novijen for no effect.",
      "action_taken": "Activated Novijen, Heart of Progress for {G}{U} to put +1/+1 counters on creatures that entered this turn, when no creatures entered this turn.",
