    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "GLM47 Proud chose not to play a land during their postcombat main phase despite having 4 lands in hand (Exotic Orchard, Forest, Island, Simic Growth Chamber) and only 8 permanents on board. Missing a land drop in the mid-game when you have lands available is a clear mistake — it slows mana development for no reason. Any of the untapped lands (Forest, Island, Exotic Orchard) could have been played to increase available mana next turn.",
