    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Unnecessarily spent a charge counter on Vivid Meadow to produce colored mana when the white mana it naturally produces would have sufficed as generic mana for Broodmate Dragon. With Dragonspeaker Shaman reducing the cost to {1}{B}{R}{G}, the colored requirements could be met by Savage Lands (B or G), Vivid Crag (R), and Haven of the Spirit Dragon (any color for Dragon spells), leaving Vivid Meadow only needing to contribute generic mana.",
