      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Alibou's triggered ability was used to deal damage to Gem3P Romance (at 29 life) instead of removing Dragonspeaker Shaman, a key cost reducer for the dragon deck. With a small X value (likely 1-2 based on tapped artifacts), the face damage is negligible while killing the 2/2 Shaman would meaningfully slow down Gem3P's dragon strategy.",
