    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Gem3P Romance used a 4/4 Dragon Token to block a 1/1 Pilgrim's Eye while letting the 4/5 Alibou through unblocked. Alibou deals 4 damage (bringing them from 27 to 23 life), and more importantly, Alibou's attack trigger deals X damage where X is tapped artifacts Grok4F controls and provides a scry X. The Pilgrim's Eye is only 1 damage and a 1/1 flyer - negligible. Meanwhile, blocking Alibou with both a Dragon Token and Broodmate Dragon (double-block) would kill Alibou (8 damage total vs 5 toughness) at the cost of one 4/4 dragon dying. Removing Alibou is valuable since its attack trigger provides repeatable damage and scry based on tapped artifacts, and Grok4F has several artifacts. Letting Alibou live means it will continue to generate value on future attacks.",
