      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Failed to play Island before casting Hullbreaker Horror. By playing the land first (free action), they would have 9 mana sources, meaning after casting Hullbreaker Horror for 7, they'd have 2 mana untapped instead of 1 - enough to hold up Arcane Denial to protect their key threat from removal on Grok4F Snark's turn.",
