    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "GPT5m Rambler is choosing a card to put into hand, likely from Arcane Denial's draw effect or a similar selection. They chose Sol Ring over Arcane Signet. While Sol Ring is generally the stronger card producing 2 colorless mana for 1, GPT5m Rambler already has 8 lands/mana sources on board and is trying to reach 7 mana for Hullbreaker Horror. With 6 untapped mana sources currently available (Island, Swamp, Island, Command Tower, Bojuka Bog tapped, Sunken Hollow tapped, Dimir Signet, Island tapped), they have access to roughly 5-6 mana. Sol Ring costs 1 and produces 2 colorless, while Arcane Signet costs 2 and produces 1 colored. Sol Ring is actually the better pick here as it nets +1 mana and costs less to deploy, helping cast Hullbreaker Horror sooner. On reflection, Sol Ring is clearly the correct choice - it's almost always the right pick over Arcane Signet.",
